/**
 * Excel Export and Import Actions
 *
 * Convex actions for generating and parsing Excel files on the backend.
 * Uses "use node" directive to enable Node.js runtime with ExcelJS.
 *
 * NOTE: Currently disabled due to ExcelJS compatibility issues with Convex local backend.
 * These actions work fine in production but the local backend has trouble bundling ExcelJS.
 * For now, Excel operations should be performed on the client side.
 */
